    "body": "Indeed, it seems that [Gecko](https://dxr.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/html/HTMLMediaElement.cpp#965) run the algorithm synchronously.\nAlso [WebKit](https://github.com/WebKit/webkit/blob/c3e91c2a4588a311e10d17b3d656af9cf9764d8e/Source/WebCore/html/HTMLMediaElement.cpp#L2018) has a similar code than [Blink](https://code.google.com/p/chromium/codesearch#chromium/src/third_party/WebKit/Source/core/html/HTMLMediaElement.cpp&l=1496) here so they both run the algorithm synchronously.\n\n@foolip, is there a reason I'm missing why this is run asynchronously per-spec?\n",
